;Rowten Caves re-survey

;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
;Modifications
;

;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
;Only Rowten cave files joined into the survey are included, the remaining surveys are 
;attached to other sections of cave for the mean-time (until all joined up)

*begin rowtencaves_new

*export rowtencave_surface.5hex

*include rowtencave_surface
*include rowtencavebottom
;*include rowtencavebottom2

*equate rowtencavebottom.1	rowtencave_surface.1x



*end rowtencaves_new